# Engine Court's pump room with the coolant suit (CIPlay engine_court_acidsuit, 11-12 w08; in a fresh test world 'CI ...',
# under CIGapsWatchHealth). As engine_court_acid, but the suit from the box by the mouth: the coolant stays and costs nothing.
island Engine Court keep
offset 1.481 0.8839
hour 11
weather Calm
at 35.5 -37.5
use ecsuits
expect shown ecacid
walk 38.5 -30.5 to 40.2 -32.2 to 44 -36 to 47.9 -39.9 to 50.4 -42.4 to 47.3 -45.5
wait 6
expect unhurt
open Pump room locker
wait 2
at 47.3 -45.5 h=10
walk 47.3 -45.5 to 50.4 -42.4 to 47.9 -39.9 to 44 -36 to 40.2 -32.2 to 38.5 -30.5
expect unhurt
